    "intro_narrative": "You awaken to the shrill hiss of escaping steam and the violent shudder of the 'Iron Leviathan', a colossal clockwork airship rapidly losing altitude. The chief engineer has vanished, leaving behind only scattered blueprints and locked brass contraptions. The main boiler is dead, and the jagged peaks of the Rust Mountains are fast approaching through the porthole. Your only hope of survival is to navigate the labyrinth of pressure valves, cogwheels, and pneumatic tubes to manually reignite the ship's Aetheric Engine Core. Time is ticking, and the gears are waiting.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
